WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.856
The first to know is the phone of the driver who made the mistake: three positions in a row against the direction of the carriageway are enough to warn them.

2
00:00:09.206 --> 00:00:15.329
Oncoming drivers get the time left before they meet and what to do: keep to the right-hand lane and slow down.
